      "writtenOn": "2023-04-14T06:48:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I came up with the following, it\u0027s more compact with no repetition, not sure about more readable :)\nNot tested though but should do the work.\n```\nfor parent_type in [\u0027bridge\u0027, \u0027link\u0027]:\n    parent \u003d self._get_parent_interface(device, iface_dict, f\u0027parent_{parent_type}\u0027)\n    nb_parent_type \u003d \u0027parent\u0027 if parent_type \u003d\u003d \u0027link\u0027 else parent_type  # What we call link here, NB calls it parent\n    if getattr(nbiface, nb_parent_type, None) !\u003d parent:\n        setattr(nbiface, nb_parent_type, parent)\n        self.log_info(f\"Attach interface {nbiface.name} to {parent_type} {parent.name}\")\n```",
